(Cyberdeck OS Beta 1 \(Plow\)) '
(How-To guide) '
() '
(README.md) '
() '
(Cyberdeck OS How-To guide) '
() '
(Status: written for Beta 1 \(Plow\). The chapters below match this image. They are not a) '
(substitute for the specification.) '
() '
(This guide ships on the desktop as a PDF and an ODT file. Okular opens the PDF.) '
() '
(This guide is licensed under [CC BY 4.0]\(../../LICENSE-docs\). Copyright \(c\) 2026 Richard) '
(Colbert. Credit Richard Colbert and Cyberdeck OS if you share or adapt it.) '
() '
(The behavior the guide describes is specified in [../SPEC.md]\(../SPEC.md\).) '
() '
(Chapters) '
() '
(1. [Installing]\(install.md\)) '
(2. [Live use]\(live-use.md\)) '
(3. [Updates]\(updates.md\)) '
(4. [Repair and rollback]\(repair-rollback.md\)) '
(5. [Maintenance]\(maintenance.md\), including Wi-Fi, the clock, and support links) '
(6. [Adding software]\(adding-software.md\)) '
(7. [Other systems with Distrobox]\(containers.md\)) '
(8. [Drives and Project Nomad]\(drives.md\)) '
(9. [Meshtastic]\(meshtastic.md\)) '
(10. [Ham and SDR tools]\(ham-tools.md\)) '
() '
(install.md) '
() '
(Installing) '
() '
(Status: written for Beta 1 \(Plow\).) '
() '
(Download the ISO from GitHub Releases. Join the parts if the release split the file, check) '
(SHA256, then write the USB. Secure Boot stays off. The full walk-through is) '
([docs/INSTALL.md]\(../INSTALL.md\).) '
() '
(On the live desktop, open Install Cyberdeck OS. Erase disk replaces the disk with GPT, an) '
(EFI system partition, and a Btrfs root. Install alongside needs a GPT disk with free) '
(space. Manual partitioning is the advanced path. Calamares asks for the account password.) '
() '
(The boot menu title is Cyberdeck OS Alpha 3 \(Hatchet\). It lists the 7.3 backports kernel) '
(and the Debian 13 6.12 kernel.) '
() '
(This guide is licensed under [CC BY 4.0]\(../../LICENSE-docs\).) '
ET
endstream
endobj
