() '
(Support) '
() '
(Support Cyberdeck OS in the menu opens X Money, Cash App, and Venmo. Nothing is charged) '
(from that window.) '
() '
(This guide is licensed under [CC BY 4.0]\(../../LICENSE-docs\).) '
() '
(adding-software.md) '
() '
(Adding software) '
() '
(Status: written for Beta 1 \(Plow\).) '
() '
(Debian packages install with apt. The host sources are Debian 13 \(main, contrib, non-free,) '
(non-free-firmware\), updates, security, and backports. Do not add Ubuntu, Sid, or Testing.) '
() '
(These are already in the full image: the network tools \(nmap, zenmap, Wireshark, tcpdump,) '
(and the rest of that set except Kismet\), qBittorrent, Tor Browser launcher, KeePassXC,) '
(Syncthing, GParted, Okular, BleachBit, Remmina, FileZilla, Ark, 7-Zip, Xarchiver, KCalc,) '
(Qalculate!, Galculator, the build tools, Git, Rust from Debian, Node, Go, the radio tools) '
(that Debian ships \(JS8Call, Pat, Dire Wolf, Xastir, gpsd\), WireGuard, ClamAV, Lynis,) '
(cool-retro-term, btop, Conky, and Foliate.) '
() '
(GIMP, Krita, Kdenlive, Audacity, OBS Studio, Calibre, KiCad, Arduino, PlatformIO, the KDE) '
(games set, RetroArch, PeaZip, GitHub Desktop, Brave, Signal, VS Code, VirtualBox, and Grok) '
(Bot install when the machine is online. Open Install Extras or wait for its timer. They) '
(are not copied into the ISO because of size or license.) '
() '
(Kismet, SpeedCrunch, FoxtrotGPS, Briar, and VeraCrypt are not in Debian 13 and this image) '
(does not add an unsigned repository for them.) '
() '
(Chrome and Grok Bot come from their publishers' apt repositories. The packages are not) '
(stored in the ISO.) '
() '
(This guide is licensed under [CC BY 4.0]\(../../LICENSE-docs\).) '
() '
(containers.md) '
() '
(Other systems with Distrobox) '
() '
(Status: written for Beta 1 \(Plow\).) '
() '
(The image includes Distrobox and Podman. Use them when a program is packaged for Ubuntu or) '
(Arch.) '
() '
(distrobox create --name ubuntu --image ubuntu:24.04) '
(distrobox enter ubuntu) '
ET
endstream
endobj
