(Ham and SDR tools) '
() '
(Status: written for Beta 1 \(Plow\).) '
() '
(The full image includes GQRX, WSJT-X, Fldigi, CHIRP, JS8Call, Pat, Dire Wolf, Xastir, and) '
(gpsd. FoxtrotGPS is not in Debian 13, so it is not installed. Map tiles you add yourself) '
(belong under /library.) '
() '
(Serial consoles for radios and boards use minicom, picocom, or screen. Arduino IDE and) '
(PlatformIO install with the Install Extras. KiCad does too.) '
() '
(This guide is licensed under [CC BY 4.0]\(../../LICENSE-docs\).) '
() '
ET
endstream
endobj
